<div class="signup-layout"><div class="signup-copy"><span class="public-kicker">Comece agora</span><h1>Sua agenda inteligente em poucos minutos.</h1><p>Crie sua empresa, inicie o teste e siga direto para a configuração. Nenhum cadastro manual é necessário.</p><ul><li>Sem cartão nos planos elegíveis</li><li>Dados isolados por empresa</li><li>Cancele quando quiser</li></ul></div><div class="card signup-card"><div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5"><h2 class="h4">Crie sua conta</h2><?php if($error):?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?=htmlspecialchars($error,ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8')?></div><?php endif;?><form method="post" data-warn-unsaved><?=\App\Core\CSRF::field()?><?php if(!empty($offer)):?><input type="hidden" name="offer" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($offer,ENT_QUOTES,"UTF-8")?>"><?php endif;?><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-sm-6"><label class="form-label">Seu nome</label><input class="form-control" name="owner_name" required autocomplete="name"></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label class="form-label">WhatsApp</label><input class="form-control" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel"></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">E-mail profissional</label><input class="form-control" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></div><div class="col-sm-7"><label class="form-label">Nome da empresa</label><input class="form-control" name="company_name" required></div><div class="col-sm-5"><label class="form-label">Segmento</label><select class="form-select" name="category"><option>Barbearia</option><option>Salão</option><option>Unhas</option><option>Estética</option><option>Lava-jato</option><option>Detailing</option><option value="Arena esportiva">Arena / Centro esportivo</option><option>Dentista</option><option>Consultório</option><option>Clínica</option><option>Outro</option></select></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Plano</label><select class="form-select" name="plan_id" required><?php foreach($plans as $p):?><option value="<?=(int)$p['i